# ABOUTME: Gitignore for the LLMday Texas 2026 talk repo.
# ABOUTME: Covers editor, OS, and presentation binary artifacts.

# Editor
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Secrets and credentials
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key

# Presentation binaries
# Block stray pptx files in the repo root or other ad-hoc locations,
# but allow tracked decks under presentations/. The repo's actual policy
# is "decks belong in presentations/ and are tracked"; this preserves
# the safety net against accidental commits elsewhere.
# Note: *.key already excluded above; covers both SSH keys and Apple Keynote files.
*.pptx
!presentations/*.pptx
*.keynote

# Demo runtime artifacts (generated by demo/setup.sh, never committed)
# Per v4.1 of the demo spec, all runtime artifacts live under
# demo/.local/ so a single directory exclusion covers them: kubeconfig,
# projected token, audit log tail, the hydrated iac-repo with its real
# .git/, and any other ephemeral build output setup.sh produces.
demo/.local/
demo/*.mp4
demo/*.mov
.claude/
